<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>Western Colorado Railroads</name>
    <description><![CDATA[(Click to expand)<br>===========DESCRIPTION===========<br><br>This is a comprehensive map of all railroads in western Colorado (west of the continental divide). This map was made entirely by hand so it is as accurate as possible though much of the routes where I was unable to find a map are approximately mapped out.<br><br>Made by Jacob M. Dougherty, <br>2022-Curant Day<br>grandvalleyminehunter@gmail.com<br><br>=============SOURCES=============<br><br>Other/more detailed maps used for reference-<br><br>-Silverton<br>https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/viewer?hl=en&mid=1cqlLEQykPSkFHBx3cuKJYDWNazH2O0Xy&ll=37.85766658803896%2C-107.6400442472168&z=12<br><br> -Rio Grande Sothern<br>https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/viewer?hl=en&mid=1wV0uynA8j_AFx3KCzV-QJKYzEck&ll=37.754695227075736%2C-108.40542691764027&z=9<br><br>https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/viewer?hl=en&mid=1IV89TxD2pIyxqBQ40RSc25cGAccvaYyg&ll=37.754695227075736%2C-108.40542691764027&z=9<br><br>-Full Colorado<br>https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/viewer?hl=en&mid=1yryn4ssrKFgB-CyfOL-mFGdlyVs&ll=38.827001335040805%2C-105.49885985&z=7<br><br>https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/viewer?hl=en&mid=1FxzYIp3j44mlO2f7RK9EAQ8hnbN8GLo&ll=39.46232651095728%2C-108.04680775&z=7<br><br>-Little Book Cliff<br>https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/viewer?hl=en&mid=1cxCY-H_JUTWTSyJfo_6D9gA43Mw&ll=39.13816794172725%2C-108.5234304&z=12<br><br>-Mesa County<br>https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/viewer?hl=en&mid=1MguNB5b8DdNJ5JNWIEr8X3mD0EbCH0E&ll=38.93782217486558%2C-108.22194145&z=10<br><br>=========STILL NEEDS WORK=========<br>-Delta to Oliver<br>-Delta to Montrose<br>-Glenwood to Pando <br>-Spur/Sidings in Grand Junction Yard]]></description>
